2. |Case|:**registration**
```pseudocode
ROUTE /register
    IF REQUEST_METHOD IS POST THEN
        username = escape(request.form['username'])
        password = escape(request.form['password'])
        IF user_manager.register(username, password) THEN
            FLASH 'Registration successful!'
            REDIRECT to url_for('login')
        ELSE
            FLASH 'Username already exists!'
        ENDIF
    ENDIF
    RENDER registration.html

CLASS UserManager
    FUNCTION register(username: str, password: str) -> bool
        IF username IN self.users THEN
            RETURN False  // Username already exists
        ENDIF
        self.users[username] = password
        OPEN users_file IN append mode
            WRITE username + '|' + password + '\n'
        CLOSE users_file
        RETURN True
```

